Third-party code. This repository contains no third-party code. Every file
in it was written for this library.

Dependencies. This library depends on Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4)
and Mathlib (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4), and through
Mathlib on its own dependencies. Lake fetches them at build time; they are not
vendored here, are distributed separately under their own licenses, and no
authorship of upstream material is claimed.

Mathematics. The results are classical in spirit (Fekete's lemma and its
continuous-time and near-subadditive variants). The README and
docs/what-is-proved.md cite the works they build on.

AI assistance. AI coding assistants were used for drafting the Lean proofs,
extracting them into this library, and writing documentation under Le Chen's
direction. Every proof is checked by the Lean kernel. The README names the
additional checks and the statements they cover.
